### =========================
### LOGIN (LOCAL)
### =========================
POST http://localhost:8080/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "Chris",
  "password": "TEST123"
}

###

### LOGIN (EC2)
POST http://ec2publicaddress:8081/MyApp/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "Chris",
  "password": "TEST123"
}

###

### =========================
### USER
### =========================

### Create User (LOCAL)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "Chris",
  "password": "TEST123",
  "confirmPassword": "TEST123"
}

###

### Get User by Username (LOCAL)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user/Chris

###

### Get User by ID (EC2)
GET http://ec2publicaddress:8081/MyApp/api/user/id/1

###

### =========================
### ITEM
### =========================

### Get Item by ID
GET http://ec2publicaddress:8081/MyApp/api/item/1

###

### Get Item by Name
GET http://ec2publicaddress:8081/MyApp/api/item/name/Square%20Widget

###

### =========================
### CART
### =========================

### Add to Cart (EC2)
POST http://ec2publicaddress:8081/MyApp/api/cart/addToCart
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

{
  "username": "Chris",
  "itemId": 2,
  "quantity": 5
}

###

### Remove from Cart (EC2)
POST http://ec2publicaddress:8081/MyApp/api/cart/removeFromCart
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

{
  "username": "Chris",
  "itemId": 2,
  "quantity": 3
}

###

### =========================
### ORDER
### =========================

### Submit Order (LOCAL)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/order/submit/Chris

###

### Submit Order (EC2)
POST http://ec2publicaddress:8081/MyApp/api/order/submit/Chris

###

### Order History (EC2)
GET http://ec2publicaddress:8081/MyApp/api/order/history/Chris
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>